"**The lyric (draft 5, locked 'A').** Three lines, each chosen from three options: chorus line 6 'to a song I haven't heard since I was twelve' (choruses 1 and 2); verse 2 line 3 'it's the same red they sent me in July'; pre-chorus 2 line 2 'and this time I don't wait for the one'.\n",
