f"**The synth riff (the engine's answer to 205).** {R['riff_drawn']} two-beat figures drawn on sixteenths (3–6 notes, scale steps from the bar's root, above the voice); {R['riff_pass']} passed (rhythm inside the pop band, nothing a semitone from the voice's held note in any of the 24 chorus slots, nothing under G4). Ranked on chord tones on the beat, notes off the beat, a leap, a turn, four or five notes, no repeated note, and not related to the vocal hook. The pick: onsets {r[1]} in twelfths from beat 3, steps {r[2]} (over E♭: E♭5 A♭5 E♭5 F5 E♭5); rhythm {r[3]:.2f} bits; chord tones on the beat {pc(r[4])}; {pc(r[5])} of its notes off the beat; not related to the hook. Placed on beats 3–4 of intro bars 1–4, of the second bar of every chorus line (24 times, moved to each bar's chord, while the voice holds), and of outro bars 85–87: 31 statements.\n",
